  "operation": "Load unchanged original map/group, area and logical-entity-tag tables with original GConfig parsers. Resolve explicit original logical identity mapping with unchanged MapLoEntityIdManager; extract the original GetEntityTag method body with two explicit local service substitutions, preserving its lookup order and empty-tag branch. Forward original map-group/area/ground queries and live entity state; require explicit destruction and function-disable host inputs.",
  "validation_entry": "Zjcs.Editor.Map14.OfficialMap14DisplayDataAcceptance.Run",
  "validation": "Unity 2022.3.57f1c2 internal-display D3D11 isolated import/compile/Play Mode passed: exact original map/area/tag tables and original parser postprocessing; independent parser scope/global factory restoration; original logical mapping and empty/nonempty/container isolation branches; original removing/position reads; original map group/area/ground queries and explicit host-state forwarding. Query fixture restores original placement 201 LoGridTransform position/direction/flip into the original 6106 template before original registration, Awake and container Start. Native visibility/four-statue/cost/radar/input/container/loading regressions passed and current rendered frames were viewed. Full ProjectTools.Validate and Windows Player remain pending.",
  "limitations": [
    "Local mapping registration is a required host input; this binding does not infer placement-to-runtime identities or server state. The 6106 query fixture does not validate dungeon gameplay. Formal four-statue host wiring, player/map/UI/simulated input/save, full ProjectTools.Validate and Windows Player remain pending."
  ]
